// 289's lamp (general/configs/xplamp.obj, its macro_genilamp; 2011's lamp,
// the same obj 2528). Untradeable and unbankable, as 289's and as 2011's
// (2011 wiki, Lamp, 2 May 2011: "tradeable = No"; banking one says "A
// magical force prevents you from banking this item"). 289 weighs it 100g;
// the 2011 wiki gives 0, so it has no weight here.
[lamp]
desc=Wonder what happens if I rub it...
tradeable=no
param=unbankable,^true
